7    76   introduction system (h-TISIS), has been reported for reliable ICP- assays of complex
8
9    77   samples.14,15 With the injection of a mere few microliters of sample, matrix effects have showed
10
11   78   to become insignificant as the temperature of the spray chamber is set at 350°C for fuels and
12
13   79   diverse acid digested environmental samples.14,15 Moreover, direct analysis of hydrocarbon
14
15   80   samples has also proven to be feasible.14 Readers are referred to a series of reviews describing
