docs/night-loop-spec.md:9:Karen kicks off `npm run night-loop` before bed (or launchd does it). The loop runs for a bounded duration (default 8 hours) or until a token budget is reached or the action queue runs out, executing the orchestrator's prioritized actions sequentially. By morning, the working tree shows commits with synthesized cells, fixed routing entries, and ingested papers; a morning report at `data/evidence/morning-report-<date>.md` summarizes what landed.
